description:
This is my first actual SMP video that I'm uploading for once, so don't bash on me too hard if it's kinda butt. This is also taken place BEFORE Smore rebrand/ending, just for clarification this isn't a Legends SMP upload

SPOILERS IF YOU HAVEN’T WATCHED: 

I would like to point out a few minor details I messed up that I forgot to change before people attack me. Paper is too optimized for machines like the orbital strike cannon to function, NOT unoptimized. We rewrote a new version of paper that would allow the cannon to work on the main server, though this code isn’t released to the public (and it probably never will). This video was purely made for entertainment purposes and even though I did build the cannon, There’s a lot of complexities I missed or may have not addressed so bear with me  (I called the Control Panel the console for most of the video as an example). There are other parts of the video that I didn’t mention as I thought they were irrelevant and it didn’t need too much context. For example, for the fight at the very end of the video it’s seen that me and Kwilver both have Maces. These aren’t technically craftable however we ended up sneaking them in via a bug that was found on the server. I couldn’t really find a way to tie it to the plot so I never really included it in the video, so before people ask, that’s why though I doubt people will care. 

This video wouldn't have been done without @Joyxz would probably execute me if I didn't credit him he would Youtube strike my channel. And obviously this couldn't have been done without @cubicmetre this guy is a giga genius

